                    [ 'Diode, around 455 nm', 'Only through a coating: paint, marker or spray', 'No', 'Diode module in the F2 or F2 Ultra' ],
                    [ 'Fibre and MOPA, around 1064 nm', 'Clear glass lets the beam through; usually no mark without a coating', 'No', 'F2 Ultra, F1 Ultra' ],
                ] ],
                [ 'h2', 'Surface engraving or 3D engraving inside glass?' ],
                [ 'p', 'Surface engraving is a frosted white design on the outside of the glass: a name on a wine glass, a logo on a decanter, a pattern on a coaster. You can feel the mark with your finger, and both a UV and a CO₂ laser can make it.' ],
                [ 'p', '3D crystal engraving, also called inner or subsurface engraving, happens inside the block. At the focus below the surface, the laser places thousands of microscopic points, layer by layer, and together they form a three-dimensional image: a portrait, a building, a logo or a model. The surface stays untouched. Neither a CO₂ nor a diode laser can do this; it is a job for a UV laser, such as the one in the xTool F2 Ultra UV.' ],
                [ 'h2', 'xTool F2 Ultra UV: a 5 W UV laser for glass and crystal' ],
                [ 'p', 'xTool calls the F2 Ultra UV a master of glass. It is a machine with a 5 W UV laser that, according to the manufacturer, handles 3D inner engraving in crystal, embossing, cutting and precision flat and rotary engraving. Its list of compatible materials includes crystal, glass, ceramics, acrylic, plastics, metal and wood.' ],
                [ 'p', 'Two 48 MP cameras help you align designs precisely even on small items, and the speed reaches 15,000 mm/s. The software turns a 2D image into a 3D engraving in one click, which makes it easier to prepare a design from a customer’s photo. xTool also highlights cold processing: edges without burn marks, no coating and no polishing after engraving. You can buy the machine on its own, with a conveyor or as a Deluxe Bundle.' ],
                [ 'p', 'What not to expect: with 5 W, the F2 Ultra UV won’t replace a CO₂ laser for cutting thick wood or acrylic sheets. It marks metal too, but more than 100 colours on metal, embossing and cutting brass and stainless steel are jobs for the 60 W MOPA laser in the F2 Ultra. Inner engraving also has size limits: xTool notes that oversized crystal balls go beyond this machine’s inner engraving area.' ],
                [ 'products', '9187692970197' ],
                [ 'h2', 'What can you make from glass and crystal to sell?' ],
