                [ 'p', 'The set makes sense when you sell corporate and occasion gifts in different materials: crystal awards alongside engraved tumblers, or sets of glasses with metal hip flasks. The two machines run in parallel, so while one engraves crystal, the other marks metal. If you only work with glass, the F2 Ultra UV alone is enough; if you mostly work with metal, choose the F2 Ultra.' ],
